	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Table Plus]]></title>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Table Plus builds a table from Row and Cell blocks. On the page, header rows become the table head, with header cells, and footer rows become the table foot. Open the page in the editor to add rows and columns from the block toolbar, switch a row to a header or footer, or press Tab to move between cells.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Header, body and footer rows</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A table with the default cell borders.</p>
